❗️ The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to launch strikes against the port infrastructure and vessels of Ukraine operating in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

During the night on 9 August air- and ground-based high-precision weapons, as well as attack UAVs, hit:

📍 at Port of Odessa, POL depots and military equipment, as well as a port transshipment facility;

📍 at Port of Chernomorsk, POL depots and military equipment;

📍 in Belyary (27 km north-east of Port of Odessa) and Novye Belyary (28 km north-east of Port of Odessa), fuel tanks intended for the AFU.

🔹Russian Defence Ministry

Жители Новосибирска публикуют фотографии и видео, как в центре города перекладывают асфальт, укладывают газон, ремонтируют тротуары и фасады зданий

